  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening activities for achievement of goals 90-90-90 and STOP-TB in the Republic of Uzbekistan with Particular Focus on Most at Risk Population - Uzbekistan (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uzbekistan, TB/HIV, Republican Center to Fight AIDS (RAC)This program has the following goals: To achieve impactful, efficient and sustainable HIV and TB response in Uzbekistan. The objectives of this program are: To scale up access for early and quality HIV and TB diagnosis, treatment, care and prevention with focus on key affected populations.  To ensure integrated care for populations affected both by TB and HIV infection.  To strengthen national public health system response to ensure universal access to integrated people-centered health services, based on the evidence-based, human rights and gender-sensitive approach</narrative>
  </description>
